{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is near, grab and check it. If path is blocked, move around. If clear, move to goal. Else, scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveAroundObstacle    /> <Action ID = MoveToGoal    /> <Action ID = ScanForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsPathBlocked    /> <Condition ID = IsPathClear    />",
